---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
 title="Terms of Service | Instant Typing"
 description="Read the terms of service, acceptable use policies, disclaimer of warranties, and intellectual property terms for instanttyping.com."
 canonicalPath="/terms"
>
 <article class="max-w-3xl mx-auto space-y-8 text-ds-text-primary ">
 <header class="border-b shadow-ds-border pb-6">
 <h1 class="text-ds-text-primary text-4xl sm:text-5xl font-semibold tracking-[-0.03em] leading-[1.1] text-balance" data-i18n="terms.title">
 Terms of Service
 </h1>
 <p class="text-xs text-ds-text-secondary mt-2 font-mono" data-i18n="terms.effective">
 Effective Date: September 2026
 </p>
 </header>

 <section class="space-y-3">
 <h2 class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-semibold tracking-[-0.02em] leading-[1.2] text-balance text-ds-text-primary " data-i18n="terms.s1_heading">1. Acceptance of Terms</h2>
 <p class="font-normal text-pretty text-sm leading-relaxed text-ds-text-secondary " data-i18n="terms.s1_body">
 By accessing or utilizing Instant Typing (instanttyping.com), you acknowledge that you have read, understood, and agree to be bound by these Terms of Service and our Privacy Policy. If you do not agree to these terms, you must refrain from using the service.
 </p>
 </section>

 <section class="space-y-3">
 <h2 class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-semibold tracking-[-0.02em] leading-[1.2] text-balance text-ds-text-primary " data-i18n="terms.s2_heading">2. Description of Service</h2>
 <p class="font-normal text-pretty text-sm leading-relaxed text-ds-text-secondary " data-i18n="terms.s2_body">
 Instant Typing provides educational web-based software for measuring keyboard input velocity, character accuracy, and typing proficiency metrics. The service is provided free of charge for personal, educational, and professional self-assessment.
 </p>
 </section>

 <section class="space-y-3">
 <h2 class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-semibold tracking-[-0.02em] leading-[1.2] text-balance text-ds-text-primary " data-i18n="terms.s3_heading">3. Acceptable Use Policy</h2>
 <p class="font-normal text-pretty text-sm leading-relaxed text-ds-text-secondary " data-i18n="terms.s3_intro">
 Users agree not to:
 </p>
 <ul class="list-disc list-inside text-xs sm:text-sm space-y-1.5 text-ds-text-secondary ">
 <li data-i18n="terms.s3_li1">Deploy automated scripts, bots, macro recorders, or browser extensions intended to artificially inflate test scores.</li>
 <li data-i18n="terms.s3_li2">Conduct denial-of-service attacks, reverse engineer web assets, or attempt unauthorized network penetration.</li>
 <li data-i18n="terms.s3_li3">Misrepresent generated skill certificates as officially accredited state licensing or university degrees.</li>
 </ul>
 </section>

 <section class="space-y-3">
 <h2 class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-semibold tracking-[-0.02em] leading-[1.2] text-balance text-ds-text-primary " data-i18n="terms.s4_heading">4. Performance Certificates Disclaimer</h2>
 <p class="font-normal text-pretty text-sm leading-relaxed text-ds-text-secondary " data-i18n="terms.s4_body">
 Certificates generated by our client-side software reflect performance metrics calculated during individual unproctored testing sessions. While accurate to international 5-keystroke typing calculation standards, they are self-directed assessments and do not constitute proctored, notarized legal certification unless audited by an employer.
 </p>
 </section>

 <section class="space-y-3">
 <h2 class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-semibold tracking-[-0.02em] leading-[1.2] text-balance text-ds-text-primary " data-i18n="terms.s5_heading">5. Disclaimer of Warranties</h2>
 <p class="font-normal text-pretty text-sm leading-relaxed text-ds-text-secondary " data-i18n="terms.s5_body">
 The service is provided on an "AS IS" and "AS AVAILABLE" basis without warranties of any kind, whether express or implied. We do not guarantee that the site will be uninterrupted, error-free, or compatible with every hardware device or virtual input keyboard.
 </p>
 </section>

 <section class="space-y-3">
 <h2 class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-semibold tracking-[-0.02em] leading-[1.2] text-balance text-ds-text-primary " data-i18n="terms.s6_heading">6. Modifications to Terms</h2>
 <p class="font-normal text-pretty text-sm leading-relaxed text-ds-text-secondary " data-i18n="terms.s6_body">
 We reserve the right to revise or replace these terms at any time. Continued use of the platform after updates are published constitutes binding acceptance of the modified terms.
 </p>
 </section>
 </article>
</Layout>
